      <description><![CDATA[<p>Update no longer promises what it can’t deliver. Skillori now reads a Claude Code plugin’s version the way Claude Code does, so new files under the same version aren’t called an update. And when an update ends without changing anything, the line tells you why instead of quietly saying Update again.</p>]]></description>
